language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Knock down a set of dummies, each numbered, so that the numbers on the knocked-down dummies add up to exactly the target sum.
given values_dim1 : int(1..)
given values : matrix indexed by [int(1..values_dim1)] of int(0..1000000)
given target_sum : int(0..1000000)
find dummies : matrix indexed by [int(1..values_dim1)] of bool

branching on [dummies]

such that
$ the numbers on the dummies knocked over add up to exactly the target sum, neither more nor less
(sum i : int(1..values_dim1) . toInt(dummies[i]) * values[i]) = target_sum
